// The registered types (GameDefinitions/Generated/PropertyMaps.inl) that are
// declared with the class key `class`: MSVC's name for them starts with it
// (Mac/TypeNames/MsvcTypeName.h). Every other registered class type is a
// `struct`. The build compares both with the declarations
// (Mac/TypeNames/ClassKeyCheck.cpp), and fails when a type is on the wrong side.
//
// One to a line, as the property maps name it: a type, or a class template
// for all of its specialisations.

